		<title>Theatre Arts Program | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="Explore acting, stagecraft, and performance with LTCC’s Theatre Arts program. Develop creative skills, gain stage experience, and prepare for transfer or careers in the performing arts. " />
